degree.

00:02:17.379 --> 00:02:25.359
The idea, I believe, is that a disproportionate
number of the bad cop complaints are some

00:02:25.359 --> 00:02:29.279
of the very young officers, often without
college degrees.

00:02:29.279 --> 00:02:35.540
So if you say the only way to be an officer
is if you're under 25 is to have a bachelor's

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:37.840
